# =============================================================================
# ZACON - Docker Ignore
# =============================================================================

# Git
.git
.gitignore
.gitmodules

# Node
**/node_modules
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.js

# Next.js
**/.next
**/out

# Build
**/build
**/dist

# IDE
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Environment (produção usa variáveis do container)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Tests
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# Docs
**/docs
**/*.md
!**/README.md

# Claude
.claude

# Temporários
**/tmp
**/temp

# Certificados locais
certbot
